/T (Most organizations still connect AI directly to raw schemas, inconsistent metrics, and custom APIs, leading to hallucinations, security risks, and brittle integrations that break whenever schemas or platforms change. The result is a proliferation of one-off projects, mounting governance risk, and data teams trapped as permanent translators between business intent and technical reality.)
